caption:
Stay until the end for a giveaway! Here are some authentic spots in Chinatown London to get Singaporean / Malaysian food! A D 

@yiqipanasia is the hottest new restaurant in Chinatown fusing South and East Asian flavours together. Their must try’s are the yuzu spicy chilli crab, charcoal chicken wings and border fried rice (Malaysian and Thailand flavours) 

@rasasayang_london is a must try for authentic flavours, their chilli crab is a beloved dish on the menu but also try the chicken rice, mee goreng, satay and beef horfun. 

Don’t miss your opportunity to enter the giveaway hosted by @chinatownlondon and @discoverhongkong where you can win a trip to Hong Kong! Check out @chinatownlondon pinned post. 

